QuestGuidance.Register("en",286,{
[9121]="7004CEFE\n1\tSpeak to Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth.\n",
[9122]="70048F6C\n1\tMithrandir can be found near the Black Gate You have been summoned by Mithrandir, who wishes you to enter Mordor on his behalf.\t\n2\tTalk to Mithrandir near the Black Gate\tMithrandir can be found near the Black Gate You have been summoned by Mithrandir, who wishes you to enter Mordor on his behalf.\n3\tTalk to Sador at the Black Gate\tSador can be found at the Black Gate You have been summoned by Sador, whose company has entered Mordor.\n",
[9123]="70018C1F\n1\tGather boar-meat (total: 5)\tThe dried boar-meat is near the wolf-dens west of the Festival Grounds, on the west side of the Greenway. Sally Blackwort has asked you to find and bring back some boar-meat that she was drying for the Yule festival feast.\n2\tBring the boar-meat to Sally Blackwort\030Collect Boar-meat (total: 5)\tSally Blackwort is at the Festival grounds in the Horsefields. Sally Blackwort will be pleased to receive the recovered boar-meat so she may begin preparing the Yule festival feast.\n",
[9124]="7004B2DE\n1\tDestroy Mornaur-forged weapons (total: 10)\tMornaur-forged weapons can be found in the Mornaur Look-out. You should destroy Mornaur-forged weapons.\n",
[9125]="70016A9D\n1\tBring the leaves to Celebrandir in Gwingris\030Collect holly-leaves (total: 8)\tHolly leaves can be found at the bases of holly-trees in Pend Eregion. You should gather more holly leaves and bring them to Celebrandir in Gwingris.\n",
[9126]="7004AC08\n1\tCatch sneaky tree-rats (quantity: see journal)\tSneaky tree-rats can be found in the limbs of trees in Agarnaith. You should catch some sneaky tree-rats for Viznak.\n",
[9127]="70057D25\n1\tCollect chunks of silver ore (total: 2)\030Collect crude sapphires (total: 2)\030Collect piles of sand (total: 2)\030Collect suitable bones (total: 2)\tThe Silverdeep Mine lies to the south-east from Thorin's Hall. You can gather the materials from the mine and local beasts. Slágin specified that the bones should not be from evil creatures.\n2\tDeliver the materials to Slágin\tSlágin awaits your return in the Forging Hall of Thorin's Hall. You should deliver the materials to him.\n",
[9128]="70067535\n1\tBecome infected by stinging sea-flies ([see journal]/6)\tAlong the shoreline and plains of the western part of the Cape of Umbar are sea-flies that carry terrible illnesses. To prove that you can survive in the lands, an emissary of one of the Kindred of the Coin instructed you to go get bit by the stinging sea-flies.\n2\tReturn to Stûkha at Jax Phanâl\tYou survived! The sea-flies certainly are aggressive, and their bite does carry some vile illness. You should return to the emissary in the outpost of Jax Phanâl in the north-west of the Cape of Umbar.\n",
[9129]="7000789F\n1\tCollect Blackwold strongbox\tThe main Blackwold camp is in the ruins of northern Chetwood, just east of Combe. Constable Sageford has asked you to search the Blackwold camp for another strongbox.\n2\tBring the strongbox to Constable Sageford\tConstable Sageford can be found near Combe town-centre. Sageford sent you to the Blackwold Headquarters to find another strongbox. You should return to Sageford with the news of your success.\n",
[9130]="70022D68\n1\tTalk to Candelleth at Echad Candelleth in Tal Bruinen\tEchad Candelleth in Tal Bruinen rests atop a cliff overlooking the great river. You are to seek out Candelleth there. Candelleth's message found you, and she awaits your arrival at the ruins of Echad Candelleth.\n",
[9131]="7004E492\n1\tCollect bundles of iron rods (total: 8)\030Collect sets of barrel-hoops (total: 6)\030Collect iron pick-axes (total: 6)\tIron rods, barrel-hoops, and pick-axes can be found throughout Járnfast. Foreman Brumbur has asked you to aid in preparing a shipment of iron tools and materials to Erebor.\n2\tDeliver the iron rods, barrel-hoops, and pick-axes to Foreman Brumbur in Járnfast\tForeman Brumbur can be found among the ruined mines of Járnfast. You have gathered a substantial amount of iron tools and materials. You should now deliver them to Foreman Brumbur.\n",
[9132]="700449E3\n1\tTalk to Rock\tBy completing this quest, you will receive a Morgul Crests allowance.\n",
[9133]="7001AA59\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Acquaintance of the Iron Garrison Guards.\n",
[9134]="7001AA5A\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered a Friend of the Iron Garrison Guards.\n",
[9135]="7001ACBF\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Ally of the Iron Garrison Guards.\n",
[9136]="7001ACB5\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered Kindred of the Iron Garrison Guards.\n",
[9137]="7001ACB3\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Acquaintance of the Iron Garrison Miners.\n",
[9138]="7001ACBE\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered a Friend of the Iron Garrison Miners.\n",
[9139]="7001ACB8\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Ally of the Iron Garrison Miners.\n",
[9140]="7001ACBC\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered Kindred to the Iron Garrison Miners.\n",
[9141]="7006E268\n1\tBy completing this quest, you will receive a Moria Daily Challenge token allowance.\t\n",
