[9144]="7004A3A6\n1\tDefeat Aganbâr the Cruel\tDefeat Overseer Aganbâr the Cruel in Mornaur, on the south slope of Udûn.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated Aganbâr the Cruel.\n",
[9145]="7004A394\n1\tDefeat Forgeworkers (total: 20)\tDefeat Forgeworkers in Mornaur, on the south slope of Udûn.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many Forgeworkers in Mornaur.\n",
[9146]="7004A388\n1\tDestroy weapons (total: 15)\tYou should destroy weapon crates throughout Mornaur, on the south slope of Udûn.\n2\tCompleted\tDestroyed many new-forged weapons in Mornaur.\n",
[9147]="7004C967\n1\tTalk to Dust\tBy completing this quest, you will receive an allowance of Motes, Embers and Figments.\n",
[9148]="7000F02B\n1\tDefeat the great snow-matron\tThe great snow-matron can be found in the cave east and up the hill from Zigilgund. Keli has asked you to rid Forochel of the great snow-matron who has been stirring up the peikko.\n2\tReturn to Keli at Zigilgund\tKeli is at Zigilgund, west of the peikko-cave. You should return to Keli with news of your victory of the great snow-matron.\n",
[9149]="7002F840\n1\tDefeat a den-mother at Fang Point\tFang Point is a Warg den in the planes south of Feldburg. You should defeat a den-mother at Fang Point to stop the spread of Wargs.\n2\tReturn to Captain Agelmund in Feldburg\tCaptain Agelmund can be found at his station in Feldburg. You should speak with Captain Agelmund.\n",
[9150]="7000702B\n1\tDefeat the Drake Matron\tThe drake-matron resides within the western pass of Ram Dúath, north-east of Esteldín. You should slay the drake-matron of the Ram Dúath. As long as she lives, she will only spawn more worms to cover the land in filth.\n2\tDefeat Drake Matron\tThe drake-matron resides within the western pass of Ram Dúath, north-east of Esteldín. You should slay the drake-matron of the Ram Dúath. As long as she lives, she will only spawn more worms to cover the land in filth.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the drake-matron in the valley of worms, and the northern canyons of Ram Dúath are safer for it.\n",
[9151]="7004E90B\n1\tCollect deer hides (total: 12)\tDeer can be found in Ered Mithrin. You should collect hides from harts and hinds around Ered Mithrin.\n2\tBring the hides to Hórin\tHórin can be found in Skarháld. You should return to Hórin with the hides.\n",
[9152]="70002DF1\n1\tDefeat giant stone-breakers (total: 4)\030Defeat giant rock-throwers (total: 4)\030Defeat giant head-smasher\tHostile giants may be found in the Stonemere, near Arifael's dwelling. Arifael has asked you to make your way into the Stonemere to defeat the hostile giants and defeat their leader.\n2\tTalk to Arifael\tArifael is at his dwelling near Amon Nendir, not far from the Stonemere. You should return to Arifael and tell him of your successes.\n3\tTalk to Ringhul\tRinghul is at his post upon the High Moor, north and west of Amon Nendir. Arifael asked you to return to Ringhul and tell him that his distant kinsmen have begun to come down out of the mountains with the intent of waging war upon the Trollshaws.\n",
